  "content": "<center> \n\n![RP_Banner](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b621ce00a234a542a1309f54a0132abc0ae9903c_0.webp)\n\n_**「從前，有一位玩家。<br> 那位玩家，就是你。」**_\n\n<br>\nPixels Reforged 是一個既保留 Minecraft 原始風格，又為其視覺帶來全新風貌的材質包。我們的目標不是改變 Minecraft 的獨特之處，而是以細膩且謹慎的手法強化某些視覺元素，讓整個世界變得更生動且更具沉浸感。\n<br><br>\n我們的專案計畫定期更新，並支援未來的 Minecraft 版本。現在，歡迎瀏覽畫廊，搶先體驗等待著你的世界。\n<br><br>\n\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://x.com/SPixelForge\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c203e34d55c180c9d485d83649fe2e030a8af378.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"無需任何依賴\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n  **這個材質包可完美套用於純淨 Minecraft —— 無需任何額外模組。**\n\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe1219667e03dc5a8a0d38d9a353c89ee06fd529.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"更多趣味專案\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellspacing=\"20\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/the-night-of-the-living-pumpkins\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"The Night of the Living Pumpkins Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      活死人南瓜之夜\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/railbalance\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3a7175ae8324de3de9cbfd3c3032780e5c9779a_0.webp\" alt=\"Railbalance Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      Railbalance <br>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/potion-recipes-pixels-reforged-edition!\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/543bdae3a809c8f18421b8c685cb5acf2ee52502.png\" alt=\"Potion Recipes: Pixels Reforged Edition Icon\" width=\"200\"></a><br>\n      藥水配方：像素重塑版\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/52a9136709049f32137c8ac3c85fffe3bfb4b011.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"你的支持至關重要\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br>\n<br>\n如果你喜歡我創作的內容，歡迎加入我的 Patreon 或 Ko-fi，享受所有會員專屬的獨家內容，你將能獲取大量額外內容，例如製作中畫面、幕後花絮、開發部落格等等！\n<br>\n<br>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/shadows_pixelforge/tiers\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"加入 Ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"加入 Patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47c5c5afc293799c37a2ebe57bf66a77a5fa49ae.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"常見問答\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n\n</center>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n這裡列舉了一些你可能會有的問題解答，希望能幫到你。\n\n<details>\n  <summary>常見問題</summary>\n\n> **Q：Shadow's Pixels Reforged 是一個模組/整合包/資料包/插件……嗎？**\n> \n> A：不，Shadow's Pixels Reforged 只是一個材質包，不需要任何依賴，只要純淨的 Minecraft 就能使用！\n\n> **Q：你能/你會推出基岩版嗎？**\n> \n> A：要製作能在基岩版上運作的版本，我們需要學習基岩版的運作方式。所以目前短期內還沒有這個計畫，但最終還是會推出的。\n\n> **Q：你有/你會製作模組嗎？**\n> \n> A：我們目前正在開發全新且令人興奮的模組，支持我們的 Ko-fi 或 Patreon 以獲取所有相關的最新消息！\n\n> **Q：1.0 之後會發生什麼事？**\n> \n> A：我們計畫持續更新這個材質包，加入許多新功能，這些功能將在 2.0 更新中新增。如果你想進一步了解即將推出的內容，歡迎查看這篇部落格，裡面介紹了所有即將到來的內容！<br>\n> [西班牙文部落格](https://ko-fi.com/post/Spanish-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-D1D41FDF1B) | [英文部落格](https://ko-fi.com/post/English-Planned-features-for-Pixels-Reforged-hav-E1E21FN39I)\n\n> **Q：我可以把你的材質包放進我的模組包裡嗎？**\n> \n> A：可以，只要你標明出處即可。\n\n\n</details>",
